"armor":"WP1014905","helmet":"WP1025805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1025","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[42,45,51,62,55,34],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1014905","helmet":"WP1025805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1025","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[42,45,51,62,55,34],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1014905","helmet":"WP1025805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1025","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[42,45,51,62,55,34],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1014905","helmet":"WP1025805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1025","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[42,45,51,62,55,34],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1014905","helmet":"WP1025805"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"太尉曹嵩之子，魏武帝曹操之弟。董卓之乱后，曹德随父亲曹嵩避居琅琊郡（今山东临沂）。兴平元年，曹操任兖州牧后，派泰山太守应劭护送曹嵩一家前往兖州。徐州牧陶谦因与曹操有旧怨，派部将张闿率数千骑兵突袭曹嵩一行。曹德在门中被乱军斩杀，曹嵩与小妾逃入厕所后亦遇害，全家百余口无一幸免。","tc":"太尉曹嵩之子，魏武帝曹操之弟。董卓之亂后，曹德隨父親曹嵩避居瑯琊郡（今山東臨沂）。興平元年，曹操任兗州牧后，派泰山太守應劭護送曹嵩一家前往兗州。徐州牧陶謙因與曹操有舊怨，派部將張闿率數千騎兵突襲曹嵩一行。曹德在門中被亂軍斬殺，曹嵩與小妾逃入廁所后亦遇害，全家百余口無一幸免。","en":"Son of Chief Officer Cao Song and younger brother of Emperor Wu of Wei, Cao Cao. After Dong Zhuo's upheaval, Cao De took refuge with his father Cao Song in Langya Commandery (present-day Linyi, Shandong). In 194, after Cao Cao became Governor of Yan Province, he sent the Governor of Taishan, Ying Shao, to escort Cao Song's household to Yan Province. Tao Qian, Governor of Xu Province, bearing an old grudge against Cao Cao, dispatched his officer Zhang Kai with several thousand cavalry to ambush the party. Cao De was cut down by the rampaging soldiers at the gate, while Cao Song and his concubine, who had fled into a privy, were also killed. Over a hundred members of the household perished without a single survivor.","jp":"太尉・曹嵩の子で、魏の武帝・曹操の弟。董卓の乱の後、曹徳は父の曹嵩に従って琅邪郡（現在の山東省臨沂）へと避難した。興平元年、曹操が兗州牧となると、泰山太守の応劭を派遣して曹嵩一家を兗州へと護送させた。しかし徐州牧の陶謙は曹操との旧怨から、部将の張闓に数千の騎兵を率いさせて曹嵩一行を急襲させた。曹徳は門内で乱軍に斬殺され、曹嵩と妾も厠へと逃れたものの殺害され、一家百余人は誰一人として難を逃れることはできなかった。","kr":"태위 조숭의 아들이자 위 무제 조조의 아우이다. 동탁의 난 이후 조덕은 부친 조숭을 따라 낭야군(지금의 산동 임의)으로 피신하였다. 흥평 원년, 조조가 연주목이 된 뒤 태산태수 응소를 보내 조숭 일가를 연주로 호송하도록 하였다. 서주목 도겸은 조조와의 옛 원한 때문에 부장 장개에게 수천 기병을 이끌고 조숭 일행을 급습하게 했다. 조덕은 문간에서 난군에게 참살당했고, 조숭과 첩실은 측간으로 피신하였으나 역시 살해당해 일가 백여 명이 한 사람도 화를 면치 못했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10816","remark":"","surname":"曹","surnameTc":"曹","surnameEn":"Cao","surnameJp":"曹","surnameKr":"조","surnameOther":"","name":"德","nameTc":"德","nameEn":"De","nameJp":"徳","nameKr":"덕","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"曹德","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"194","city":"CS1025","gender":"0","rule":"42","force":"45","wise":"51","politics":"62","charm":"55","will":"34","ruleTalent":"5","forceTalent":"4","wiseTalent":"6","politicsTalent":"8","charmTalent":"7","willTalent":"4","weaponMaster":"11/11/11/11/11/52/28/11","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoul